{
    "title": "Bouncie",
    "description": "Driving connected starts here.\r\n\r\nGPS Location \u203a\r\nOne vehicle or an entire fleet, see them all on one map. Bouncie captures each second of the trip, refreshing your map instantly as the vehicle drives. Enjoy the view!\r\n\r\nAccident Notification \u203a\r\nAdvanced sensors and software immediately detect vehicle accidents. Bouncie will automatically send an SMS message to your notification contacts. Just breathe!\r\n\r\nDriving Insights \u203a\r\nBouncie provides timely insights on speed, acceleration, braking, and more. Steer towards excellence!\r\n\r\nVehicle Health \u203a\r\nBouncie continually monitors your vehicle's health and alerts you when something needs your attention. Manage the little things before they become big problems!\r\n\r\nBouncie OBD Device Required \u203a\r\nBouncie is the smallest cellular OBD device anywhere and is completely self-contained!",
